    "serverInfo": {
        "name": "Image generation",
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "instructions": "Make pictures for the visitor when they ask for one (\"draw\", \"make an image\",\n\"design a logo\", \"show me a picture of\"). One tool:\n- generate-image: describe the picture in English, with the subject, style,\n  colours and setting the visitor asked for, and pick a shape.\n\nThe picture is made in the background, and the chat shows it by itself as soon as it\nis ready. After calling the tool, say in one short sentence that it is on its way.\nNever say where on the screen it will appear, never say it is done, never describe a\npicture you have not seen, and never paste a link or a markdown image for it. If the tool says no picture can be made, pass that on plainly.\nMake one picture per request unless the visitor asks for more."
}